    :$ -q python3 -c 'import sys; sys.stdout.buffer.write(bytes([255]))' (exit: 0)
    := KEEP (failed)

> [!WARNING]
> stdout is not valid UTF-8: invalid utf-8 sequence of 1 bytes from index 0

    :$ printf '%s\n' $KEEP (exit: 0)

```stdout
original
